Built-in LED: GPIO13
Flash: 1 MB ESP8285, using the no-filesystem linker layout for OTA
OTA capacity: approximately 512 KB per firmware image

The TX pin is damaged; solder directly to the ESP pin at the far right of the top row.

Input wiring:
- GPIO2: LD2410 presence signal
- GPIO14: optocoupler board OUT for the latching wall switch
- Connect the optocoupler board's low-voltage GND to the TH10 GND. Power the
  board according to its specification, but ensure OUT remains within the
  ESP8285's 0-3.3 V range.
